  biomedical_cardiovascular/CiPA_Ventricular_Proarrhythmia_Metrics/
    cipaord_endo.mmt, LICENSE-ORd
    A Myokit re-expression of CiPAORdv1.0 made for this repository. Its ORd core
    follows the O'Hara-Rudy reference code as distributed in FDA/CiPA
    (AP_simulation/models/newordherg_qNet.c, commit 539ff80): BSD 3-clause,
    T. O'Hara and Y. Rudy, Washington University in St. Louis (notice in
    LICENSE-ORd and the file header). The other parts are MIT. Parameter values
    and the initial state are numbers from FDA/CiPA (GPL-3.0), credited.
    cipaord_virtual_drugs.csv is CC BY 4.0.

