    f11c5e6 (Z. Yang, H. Gao, G. L. Smith, R. D. Simitev): Myokit's import of
    the CellML Model Repository encoding (M. Fink) of Shannon et al. 2004, with
    E_Na_SL fixed at -15 mV. No licence stated. rabbit_ap_samples.csv is CC BY 4.0.

